    "detailed_description": "<strong>A unique platformer where an evil AI predicts your movement. Dodge AI-spawned traps, solve optional puzzles and uncover the dark secrets of the simulation. Now with a level editor and infinite community-made content! </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/fc8dc7a2af44f7016f4c710c7a48dc9b.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/4c0c602a3fe67beb0ac21ef75d2a13ba.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/4c0c602a3fe67beb0ac21ef75d2a13ba.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/4c0c602a3fe67beb0ac21ef75d2a13ba.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A lot of levels in Will You Snail are relatively empty by default. The challenge comes from the interactions with the evil AI. You will jump, run, dodge and die. This game is precise, fast-paced and challenging. (Stay cool, you can change the difficulty at any time.)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/5fee8a62a6c3b2daf64e3a77ababdebf.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/97da592894facfea6295875d4b487084.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/97da592894facfea6295875d4b487084.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/97da592894facfea6295875d4b487084.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The evil AI Squid tries to predict your movement a few seconds ahead of time and uses that information in an attempt to stop you from reaching the end of the level. Will you win that intellectual battle, or will Squid find yet another reason to make fun of you?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/f8ef373f48a3cdd63a4d9f9dcc59cc9e.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/9dd16bed785d35b2ce18c54c9e856f1e.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/9dd16bed785d35b2ce18c54c9e856f1e.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/9dd16bed785d35b2ce18c54c9e856f1e.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take a break from the action and challenge yourself with a variety of puzzles, ranging from easy to quite difficult. All puzzles are completely optional and can be skipped, allowing you to fully customize your gaming experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/93203ae941824ad8d47e2d77501f42a2.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/f1beb5a307c424c3411ca6182e4c290f.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/f1beb5a307c424c3411ca6182e4c290f.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/f1beb5a307c424c3411ca6182e4c290f.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Find secrets, collect clues and try to piece together where you are and what happened. Will You Snail tells a rather crazy story about artificial intelligence, simulation theory, and the future of humanity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/0447406f6603a962847a07c76d72349c.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/6a2fae23396bf089a5b3e9787567450b.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/6a2fae23396bf089a5b3e9787567450b.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/6a2fae23396bf089a5b3e9787567450b.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Now with a level editor with Steam Workshop support! Unleash your imagination and dive into a world of endless possibilities. Build and play custom-made levels, share your creativity, watch others suffer, and take on new challenges yourself.<br><br><strong><i>Infinite creativity. Infinite nonsense. Infinite pain. Infinite content. </i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/fdbd0793b1abf8c7e3ddde6f27519aac.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/3985418dd19d7c3f61f88cbc64fbc1d9.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/3985418dd19d7c3f61f88cbc64fbc1d9.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/3985418dd19d7c3f61f88cbc64fbc1d9.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>It is in my best interest to make sure you're happy with your purchase decision, as I want to keep the reviews on this game as positive as possible. Follow the instructions below to figure out if this game is for you or if it's not...<br><br><strong>How many of the following 10 points do you like?</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Short But Action-Packed Game<br></li><li>Challenging Platforming<br></li><li>Reflex-Based Action<br></li><li>Variety Gameplay (Action, Puzzles, Racing, Combat, etc.)<br></li><li>Nonlinear Storytelling<br></li><li>Silly Voice Acting<br></li><li>Secret Hunting (looking at you, completionists)<br></li><li>A Dark Story about Simulations, AI, and the Mysteries of the Universe<br></li><li>Speedrunning <br></li><li>Cute Snails and Unicorns</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/2cdf0f601dc29e3a8fc2761a61cf854e.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><strong>If you like 8-10 points:</strong><br>You will love this game. A no-brainer.<br><br><strong>If you like 5-7 points:</strong><br>I still feel confident recommending this game to you. It is pretty customizable, and you can focus on the things you like most. Puzzles can be skipped; the difficulty can be adjusted; there is an exploration mode that instantly unlocks all levels if you just want to explore, etc. You'll have a pretty good time.<br><br><strong>If you like 3-4 points:</strong><br>Hmmm. Unfortunately, I'm not entirely sure you'll like my game. Maybe wait for a good discount if you really want to try it out.<br><br><strong>If you like 0-2 points:</strong><br>Sorry, this game is not for you.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/b4acd5dabaeed092eb7458c0d90ae898.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/698a368842d6a0f17e441bda491738b2.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br>I want to thank you all so much for your support with this project, especially my YouTube community, which helped a ton with playtesting, translations, and keeping me motivated. This is the first commercial game I'm releasing on my own, so your support means the world to me. Thank you for making this game possible!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A unique platformer where an evil AI predicts your movement. Dodge AI-spawned traps, solve optional puzzles and uncover the dark secrets of the simulation. Now with a level editor and infinite community-made content! </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/fc8dc7a2af44f7016f4c710c7a48dc9b.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/4c0c602a3fe67beb0ac21ef75d2a13ba.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/4c0c602a3fe67beb0ac21ef75d2a13ba.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/4c0c602a3fe67beb0ac21ef75d2a13ba.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A lot of levels in Will You Snail are relatively empty by default. The challenge comes from the interactions with the evil AI. You will jump, run, dodge and die. This game is precise, fast-paced and challenging. (Stay cool, you can change the difficulty at any time.)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/5fee8a62a6c3b2daf64e3a77ababdebf.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/97da592894facfea6295875d4b487084.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/97da592894facfea6295875d4b487084.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/97da592894facfea6295875d4b487084.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The evil AI Squid tries to predict your movement a few seconds ahead of time and uses that information in an attempt to stop you from reaching the end of the level. Will you win that intellectual battle, or will Squid find yet another reason to make fun of you?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/f8ef373f48a3cdd63a4d9f9dcc59cc9e.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/9dd16bed785d35b2ce18c54c9e856f1e.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/9dd16bed785d35b2ce18c54c9e856f1e.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/9dd16bed785d35b2ce18c54c9e856f1e.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take a break from the action and challenge yourself with a variety of puzzles, ranging from easy to quite difficult. All puzzles are completely optional and can be skipped, allowing you to fully customize your gaming experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/93203ae941824ad8d47e2d77501f42a2.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/f1beb5a307c424c3411ca6182e4c290f.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/f1beb5a307c424c3411ca6182e4c290f.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/f1beb5a307c424c3411ca6182e4c290f.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Find secrets, collect clues and try to piece together where you are and what happened. Will You Snail tells a rather crazy story about artificial intelligence, simulation theory, and the future of humanity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/0447406f6603a962847a07c76d72349c.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/6a2fae23396bf089a5b3e9787567450b.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/6a2fae23396bf089a5b3e9787567450b.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/6a2fae23396bf089a5b3e9787567450b.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Now with a level editor with Steam Workshop support! Unleash your imagination and dive into a world of endless possibilities. Build and play custom-made levels, share your creativity, watch others suffer, and take on new challenges yourself.<br><br><strong><i>Infinite creativity. Infinite nonsense. Infinite pain. Infinite content. </i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/fdbd0793b1abf8c7e3ddde6f27519aac.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/3985418dd19d7c3f61f88cbc64fbc1d9.poster.avif?t=1727865643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/3985418dd19d7c3f61f88cbc64fbc1d9.webm?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/3985418dd19d7c3f61f88cbc64fbc1d9.mp4?t=1727865643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>It is in my best interest to make sure you're happy with your purchase decision, as I want to keep the reviews on this game as positive as possible. Follow the instructions below to figure out if this game is for you or if it's not...<br><br><strong>How many of the following 10 points do you like?</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Short But Action-Packed Game<br></li><li>Challenging Platforming<br></li><li>Reflex-Based Action<br></li><li>Variety Gameplay (Action, Puzzles, Racing, Combat, etc.)<br></li><li>Nonlinear Storytelling<br></li><li>Silly Voice Acting<br></li><li>Secret Hunting (looking at you, completionists)<br></li><li>A Dark Story about Simulations, AI, and the Mysteries of the Universe<br></li><li>Speedrunning <br></li><li>Cute Snails and Unicorns</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/2cdf0f601dc29e3a8fc2761a61cf854e.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><strong>If you like 8-10 points:</strong><br>You will love this game. A no-brainer.<br><br><strong>If you like 5-7 points:</strong><br>I still feel confident recommending this game to you. It is pretty customizable, and you can focus on the things you like most. Puzzles can be skipped; the difficulty can be adjusted; there is an exploration mode that instantly unlocks all levels if you just want to explore, etc. You'll have a pretty good time.<br><br><strong>If you like 3-4 points:</strong><br>Hmmm. Unfortunately, I'm not entirely sure you'll like my game. Maybe wait for a good discount if you really want to try it out.<br><br><strong>If you like 0-2 points:</strong><br>Sorry, this game is not for you.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/b4acd5dabaeed092eb7458c0d90ae898.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115050/extras/698a368842d6a0f17e441bda491738b2.avif?t=1727865643\" /></div><br>I want to thank you all so much for your support with this project, especially my YouTube community, which helped a ton with playtesting, translations, and keeping me motivated. This is the first commercial game I'm releasing on my own, so your support means the world to me. Thank you for making this game possible!",
    "short_description": "A unique platformer where an evil AI predicts your movement. Dodge AI-spawned traps, solve optional puzzles and uncover the dark secrets of the simulation. Now with a level editor and infinite community-made content!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Russian, Italian, Czech, Dutch, Romanian, Arabic, Bulgarian, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Swedish, Turkish, Vietnamese, Ukrainian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cWill You SnAIl? is an expertly crafted action platformer, with gripping gameplay, a heart-wrenching futuristic story and a villain you can't help but love to hate.\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 Pure Nintendo<br><br>\u201cOverall, I think Will You Snail? is an excellent time. It was short for the price point, but that was one of my few concerns. It performed well, kept me engaged, and never felt too overwhelming despite being a rage-inducing game. Will You Snail? is an easy game to recommend.\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 Rapid Reviews UK<br><br>\u201cIf a child between Super Meat Boy and The Impossible Game was possible it would be Would You Snail?.\u201d<br>90/100 \u2013 NoobFeed<br>",
